      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Titles",
      "Anchor": "titles",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "The Titles API provides standardized job title data across the LinkedIn platform. Each position or job is mapped to a\nlist of titles and their higher granularities. Titles is a child of the superTitles entity.\nThis API doesn\u2019t share member personal data as part of the API response.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Titles",
      "Anchor": "titles",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "Titles represent standardized job titles on LinkedIn member profiles and job postings.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Titles",
      "Anchor": "titles",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "Note",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Titles",
      "Anchor": "titles",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "This API may also be referred to as \u0022Job Title\u0022 or \u0022Position Title\u0022 in other contexts.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Titles",
      "Anchor": "titles",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "Each title has a function field (resolve via Function API) and a superTitle field (resolve via Super Titles API).",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Titles",
      "Anchor": "titles",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "The service provides the following methods:",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Titles",
      "Anchor": "titles",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "Get a single Title entity.\nGet All Titles that are available in the taxonomy.\nBatch Get Titles for the set of titleIds.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "How to Retrieve Title IDs",
      "Anchor": "how-to-retrieve-title-ids",
      "SectionPath": [
        "How to Retrieve Title IDs"
      ],
      "Text": "Use GET_ALL with pagination to list all titles. Title IDs also appear in member profile experience sections returned by other DMA APIs.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Permissions",
      "Anchor": "permissions",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Permissions"
      ],
      "Text": "| Permission | Description |\n| ------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| r_dma_admin_pages_content | Retrieve your organization\u2019s posts, comments, reactions, and other engagement data. Retrieve your organization\u2019s pages and their reporting data (including follower, visitor and content analytics).\nSee Organization Access Control\nfor more information on\ncompany page roles.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Member Data Obfuscation",
      "Anchor": "member-data-obfuscation",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Permissions",
        "Member Data Obfuscation"
      ],
      "Text": "This DMA API has no member data that is obfuscated.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
